<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: ambrosia palm -->
  <VDE_AmbrosiaPalm.label>仙馐灵树</VDE_AmbrosiaPalm.label>
  <!-- EN: A legendary palm tree which yields the ambrosia fruit. Ambrosia fruit is delicious and produces a drug-like mood boost. It’s a very rare sight to see an Ambrosia tree that can be farmed for numerous years, as most common sights of Ambrosia are of the bush variety.\n\nIts rarity, beauty, and desirability are why ambrosia was named after the food of the ancient Greek gods. -->
  <VDE_AmbrosiaPalm.description>传说中的仙馐灵树，可以收获仙馐果。食用仙馐果会产生一种弱性的化学亢奋作用，从而让人感到心情愉悦。与最为常见的仙馐树不同，仙馐灵树不仅寿命很长，还能在各种恶劣的环境下茁壮扎根。\n\n稀有、美丽、诱人...种种特点使仙馐果被冠上了“众神美馔”的称号。</VDE_AmbrosiaPalm.description>
  
</LanguageData>